createRectangle [SimTalk]
Creates a rectangle in the graphic or graphic group designated by <Path> at the position (X,Y) with the
specified Width and Height.
Remarks
If you specify a negative Width, X designates the X-Position of the right hand side.
If you specify a positive Height, Y designates the Y-Position of the bottom side.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.createRectangle(X:real, Y:real, Width:real, Height:real[, 
Color:integer=-1, Thickness:real=0.08]) -> any
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The parameter X of data type real sets the X-position at which the rectangle is going to be created in
the window.
• The parameter Y of data type real sets the Y-position at which the rectangle is going to be created in the
window.
• The optional parameter Color of data type integer sets the Color of the rectangle.
Default Value of the Parameter
The default value is -1.
• The optional parameter Thickness of data type real sets the Thickness of line that forms the rectangle.
Default Value of the Parameter
The default value is 0.08.
Return Value
The return value has the data type any.
It designates the created graphic, compare the method _3D.getGraphic.
createRectangle [SimTalk]
Plant Simulation Help 12-987
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Example
-- Creates a rectangle in the graphic group named deco 
-- with the top left corner located at the position (2,-2),
-- a width of 8, and a height of 6. The color is the default color 1 and
-- the line width is 0.1.
root._3D.deco.createRectangle(2, -2, 8, -6, getStandardColor(1), 0.1)
-- Creates a rectangle in the graphic group named deco 
-- with the bottom left corner located at the position (2,-2),
-- a width of 8, and a height of 6. The color is the default color 1 and
-- the line width is 0.1.
root._3D.deco.createRectangle(2, -2, 8, 6, getStandardColor(1), 0.1)
-- Creates a rectangle in the graphic group named deco 
-- with the lower left corner located at the position (2,-2),
-- a width of 8, and a height of 6. The color is RGB(200, 0, 0) and 
-- the line width is the defaul line width of 0.08.
root._3D.getGraphic("deco").createRectangle(2, -2, -8, 6, makeRGBValue(200, 
0, 0))
See also
Box
createBox [SimTalk]
